  "description": "A 15-minute scroll module for the new baristas of Fernhill Coffee (a fictional café chain): where a coffee comes from, what processing and roasting do to its taste, and how to fix a bad brew at the bar. It uses every starter block of Elabora, the way a Rise author would.",
